# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:11
translate turkish micha7a_be31aa9e:

    # "I spend some time talking to Gertrude about the things that have been on my mind. Then when I am about to leave and head to class, she stops me."
    "Gertrude ile kafamdaki düşünceler hakkında bir süre sohbet ettim. Sonra dersime gitmek üzereyken beni durdurdu."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:12
translate turkish micha7a_039a0a46:

    # sc "Hey, before you leave, I wanted to tell you that I talked to Mi-Cha about you."
    sc "Hey, gitmeden önce, Mi-Cha ile senin hakkında konuştuğumu söylemek istedim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:13
translate turkish micha7a_ae871f39:

    # pc "Oh yeah?"
    pc "Öyle mi?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:14
translate turkish micha7a_13380f5e:

    # sc "She's very shy, but I talked her into having a little coffee meet-up with you. Can you meet her this evening?"
    sc "O çok utangaç biri ama onu ikna edip seninle küçük bir kahve buluşması ayarladım. Bu akşam onunla buluşabilir misin?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:18
translate turkish micha7a_5ec9bea1:

    # sc "Great! I'll let her know to meet you in the school café this evening."
    sc "Harika! Ona bu akşam okul kafesinde seninle buluşacağını söylerim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:19
translate turkish micha7a_a8af18a8:

    # pc "Cool, I'm looking forward to it."
    pc "Süper, sabırsızlıkla bekliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:20
translate turkish micha7a_e4769446:

    # sc "Okay, I'll see you later, [pcname]."
    sc "Tamam, sonra görüşürüz, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:23
translate turkish micha7a_9669528e:

    # "Later..."
    "Sonra görüşürüz..."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:29
translate turkish micha7a_6750acb1:

    # sc "Oh, I'm sorry. I thought you were."
    sc "Ah, özür dilerim. Öyle olduğunu sanmıştım."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:30
translate turkish micha7a_9f1153c2:

    # sc "Okay then. She'll be disappointed, but I'll let her know."
    sc "Tamam o zaman. Hayal kırıklığına uğrayacak ama ona haber vereceğim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:31
translate turkish micha7a_9c57fd84:

    # sc "I'll see you later, [pcname]."
    sc "Sonra görüşürüz, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:39
translate turkish micha7_617439f0:

    # "I head over to the café for my coffee date with Mi-Cha."
    "Mi-Cha ile kahve randevum için kafeye gidiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:44
translate turkish micha7_046f6d25:

    # "When I walk into the café, I spot Mi-Cha sitting alone at one of the tables. She sees me immediately, as if she has been staring at the door waiting for me to enter."
    "Kafeye girdiğimde, Mi-Cha'yı masalardan birinde tek başına otururken görüyorum. Sanki kapıya bakıp benim girmemi bekliyormuş gibi, beni hemen fark ediyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:47
translate turkish micha7_715a3be9:

    # "She immediately stands and walks up towards me."
    "Hemen ayağa kalkıp bana doğru yürüyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:49
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/micha_7_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_7_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:50
translate turkish micha7_b81c6f86:

    # mc "Hello, [pcname]. My name is Mi-Cha. It is very nice to meet you."
    mc "Merhaba, [pcname]. Benim adım Mi-Cha. Tanıştığımıza çok memnun oldum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:51
translate turkish micha7_65b65cd2:

    # pc "Hi, Mi-Cha. We've met already in the lobby remember?"
    pc "Merhaba, Mi-Cha. Lobide tanışmıştık, hatırladın mı?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:53
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/micha_yes1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_yes1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:54
translate turkish micha7_076877b6:

    # mc "Yes, I remember."
    mc "Evet, hatırlıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:55
translate turkish micha7_1d573332:

    # pc "Do you want a coffee?"
    pc "Kahve ister misin?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:57
translate turkish micha7_bf8efb1f:

    # "She doesn't say anything in response, instead just nodding her head slightly."
    "Cevap olarak hiçbir şey söylemiyor, sadece hafifçe başını sallıyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:60
translate turkish micha7_b6487666:

    # bn "Hi there. What can I get for you?"
    bn "Merhaba. Sana ne getireyim?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:61
translate turkish micha7_fa4d4666:

    # pc "What would you like, Mi-Cha? I'll pay. Anything you want."
    pc "Ne istersin, Mi-Cha? Hesabı ben öderim. Ne istersen."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:62
translate turkish micha7_816eccbd:

    # mc "You first, please."
    mc "Önce sen, lütfen."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:63
translate turkish micha7_c24a94ff:

    # pc "Okay. I'll have a hot vanilla latte."
    pc "Tamam. Sıcak vanilyalı latte alacağım."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:64
translate turkish micha7_0515f2bf:

    # mc "I will have the same."
    mc "Ben de aynısından alayım."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:65
translate turkish micha7_a4c27a52:

    # bn "Sure thing. Two hot vanilla lattes coming right up."
    bn "Tabii ki. İki sıcak vanilyalı latte hemen geliyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:68
translate turkish micha7_9e1b5b12:

    # "We wait for our drinks, I pay, then we go to a table and sit down."
    "İçeceklerimizi bekliyoruz, ben ödüyorum, sonra bir masaya gidip oturuyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:69
translate turkish micha7_c8eefb91:

    # "Mi-Cha doesn't say anything, just looking down at her coffee and smiling nervously."
    "Mi-Cha hiçbir şey söylemiyor, sadece kahvesine bakıp gergin bir şekilde gülümsüyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:74
translate turkish micha7_2aebf130:

    # mc "Very good, thank you."
    mc "Çok güzel, teşekkürler."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:80
translate turkish micha7_2aebf130_1:

    # mc "Very good, thank you."
    mc "Çok güzel, teşekkürler."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:83
translate turkish micha7_fa75bbc3:

    # pc "Are you okay?"
    pc "İyi misin?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:84
translate turkish micha7_dc52a31e:

    # pc "You seem a little nervous."
    pc "Biraz gergin görünüyorsun."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:86
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/micha_yes2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_yes2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:87
translate turkish micha7_d1bf83b5:

    # mc "Yes. I am."
    mc "Evet. Öyleyim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:88
translate turkish micha7_fb27d9a1:

    # pc "You don't have to be nervous around me. I'm not going to hurt you."
    pc "Benim yanımda gergin olmana gerek yok. Sana zarar vermeyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:89
translate turkish micha7_27577933:

    # mc "I know. I really want you to like me."
    mc "Biliyorum. Beni gerçekten sevmeni istiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:90
translate turkish micha7_fcf5ae2f:

    # pc "I do like you."
    pc "Seni seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:93
translate turkish micha7_81709362:

    # mc "You do?"
    mc "Öyle mi?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:94
translate turkish micha7_423fa223:

    # pc "Sure. That's why I asked Gertrude to set up this date."
    pc "Elbette. Bu yüzden Gertrude'dan bu randevuyu ayarlamasını istedim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:95
translate turkish micha7_6af12bd8:

    # mc "This is a date?"
    mc "Bu bir randevu mu?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:96
translate turkish micha7_c1f89784:

    # pc "A coffee date, yeah."
    pc "Evet, bir kahve randevusu."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:99
translate turkish micha7_57067727:

    # mc "Not the kind of date that ends in bed though?"
    mc "Ama yatakta biten türden bir randevu değil, değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:102
translate turkish micha7_7d70b936:

    # mc "Good. I do not think I am ready for that yet."
    mc "İyi. Henüz buna hazır olduğumu sanmıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:104
translate turkish micha7_8d1c80ad:

    # mc "No!"
    mc "Hayır!"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:105
translate turkish micha7_8413dde0:

    # mc "I'm sorry. I do not think I am ready for that yet."
    mc "Özür dilerim. Buna henüz hazır olduğumu sanmıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:108
translate turkish micha7_7d63d9da:

    # mc "I am very sorry. Did I offend you?"
    mc "Çok üzgünüm. Seni kırdım mı?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:109
translate turkish micha7_8b131ed8:

    # mc "I did not mean I would not want to go to bed with you. But I feel uncomfortable about it right now."
    mc "Seninle yatmak istemediğimi kastetmedim. Ama şu anda bu konuda kendimi rahatsız hissediyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:110
translate turkish micha7_0d2c9d39:

    # pc "It's okay, I wasn't suggesting that. You didn't offend me."
    pc "Sorun değil, ben öyle bir şey önermiyordum. Beni kırmadın."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:113
translate turkish micha7_0e8b4e1b:

    # mc "Oh no, I am making things worse aren't I?"
    mc "Oh hayır, durumu daha da kötüleştiriyorum, değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:114
translate turkish micha7_c767c9ce:

    # mc "I am so bad at this."
    mc "Bu konuda çok kötüyüm."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:115
translate turkish micha7_c1e312a1:

    # pc "It's okay, really. Just calm down."
    pc "Sorun değil, gerçekten. Sakin ol."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:118
translate turkish micha7_87a0b25e:

    # "I reach over and place my hand over hers. She starts to pull away at first, then relaxes."
    "Elimi uzatıp elinin üzerine koyuyorum. İlk başta çekilmeye başlıyor, sonra gevşiyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:121
translate turkish micha7_7c1c3cc4:

    # mc "Miss Spann did not tell me that you asked for this date. I thought that she set it up because she wanted me to meet people."
    mc "Bayan Spann, bu randevuyu senin istediğini bana söylememişti. İnsanlarla tanışmamı istediği için ayarladığını sanmıştım."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:122
translate turkish micha7_36fab42e:

    # mc "It does make me feel better that you requested it."
    mc "Senin istemiş olman beni gerçekten rahatlatıyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:123
translate turkish micha7_f3c20824:

    # mc "Why did you want to buy me coffee?"
    mc "Neden bana kahve ısmarlamak istedin?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:124
translate turkish micha7_f0ffbaf0:

    # pc "I don't know. I thought you were cute and could use a friend."
    pc "Bilmiyorum. Seni sevimli buldum ve bir arkadaşa ihtiyacın olabileceğini düşündüm."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:127
translate turkish micha7_41d2c325:

    # mc "You think that I am cute?"
    mc "Beni sevimli mi buluyorsun?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:128
translate turkish micha7_d54e19e4:

    # pc "Yeah. You're very cute."
    pc "Evet. Çok tatlısın."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:132
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/micha_thankyou1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_thankyou1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:133
translate turkish micha7_5b61e929:

    # mc "Thank you, [pcname]."
    mc "Teşekkürler, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:134
translate turkish micha7_61a02886:

    # mc "I… think that you are cute as well."
    mc "Ben de… senin de tatlı olduğunu düşünüyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:137
translate turkish micha7_3b1b3410:

    # mc "Oh no, I should not have said that. I can't believe I said that."
    mc "Olamaz, bunu söylememeliydim. Bunu söylediğime inanamıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:138
translate turkish micha7_84587f43:

    # pc "What? It's okay that you think I'm cute."
    pc "Ne? Beni tatlı bulman sorun değil ki."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:139
translate turkish micha7_a67a4bd1:

    # mc "No. I can't. I should go."
    mc "Hayır. Yapamam. Gitmeliyim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:140
translate turkish micha7_59ee5f3a:

    # pc "Why? You've barely drunk your coffee. I'd like to talk to you more."
    pc "Neden? Kahveni daha yeni içmeye başladın. Seninle biraz daha konuşmak isterdim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:142
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/micha_imsorry2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_imsorry2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:143
translate turkish micha7_918fea83:

    # mc "I'm sorry."
    mc "Üzgünüm."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:146
translate turkish micha7_6305b1a7:

    # mc "Is it okay if I leave?"
    mc "Gitsem sorun olur mu?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:151
translate turkish micha7_d7eacc92:

    # mc "I know better than to be so forward."
    mc "Bu kadar cüretkar olmamam gerektiğini biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:152
translate turkish micha7_cafb4599:

    # mc "I have been taught better than to say things like that."
    mc "Bana böyle şeyler söylememem gerektiği öğretildi."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:153
translate turkish micha7_f3946300:

    # mc "I am very sorry, but I would like to go now."
    mc "Çok üzgünüm, ama şimdi gitmek istiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:157
translate turkish micha7_bb0eeaf4:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "Teşekkür ederim."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:158
translate turkish micha7_c5f761de:

    # mc "I'm very sorry."
    mc "Çok üzgünüm."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:161
translate turkish micha7_3ac8722a:

    # pc "There's no reason to apologize. You haven't done anything wrong."
    pc "Özür dilemene gerek yok. Yanlış bir şey yapmadın."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:163
translate turkish micha7_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice 'voices/micha_thankyou1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/micha_thankyou1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:164
translate turkish micha7_024933de:

    # mc "Thank you. You're very kind."
    mc "Teşekkür ederim. Çok naziksin."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:165
translate turkish micha7_26dc8eb0:

    # pc "Can we at least try this again sometime?"
    pc "En azından bir ara bunu tekrar deneyebilir miyiz?"

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:168
translate turkish micha7_d6451512:

    # "She makes a squeaking sound somewhere deep in her throat, as if the words are being forcefully pushed out."
    "Sanki kelimeler zorla dışarı itiliyormuş gibi, boğazının derinliklerinden bir ciyaklama sesi çıkarır."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:169
translate turkish micha7_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "Evet."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:172
translate turkish micha7_f5c4b536:

    # "Then she practically runs out of the café."
    "Sonra adeta koşar adımlarla kafeden çıkıyor."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:175
translate turkish micha7_b95ac3d7:

    # "Well that was definitely one of the weirder first dates I've had. Not sure what was going on with her."
    "Bu kesinlikle yaşadığım en tuhaf ilk randevulardan biriydi. Ona ne olduğunu tam olarak anlayamadım."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:176
translate turkish micha7_9788c24f:

    # "But she did say yes to another date."
    "Ama bir sonraki randevuya evet dedi."

# game/Scenes/Micha/micha7.rpy:179
translate turkish micha7_2b06c7c2:

    # "Maybe that one will go a little more smoothly."
    "Belki o randevu biraz daha sorunsuz geçer."

